    <string name="avatar_about_title">What can this do?</string>
    <string name="avatar_hover_about">What this room does, in plain words</string>
    <string name="avatar_about_body">Build a character from a layered file, a sheet, loose pictures or one whole drawing. The parts row shows what you have; each part has a card that says what it does.

Heads turn through as many angles as you drew, and missing sides can be mirrored. Arms swap between drawings and bend to reach. Mouths talk on a hinge, by squashing, or by swapping shapes to the voice. Eyes follow and blink. Tails swing. The chest breathes.

Perform by talking, turning the head on the pad, tapping buttons and walking the body. Record in passes: a second pass only replaces what you touch.</string>
